{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367590/extras/2005a14f1548b52dbb9e9d0ff073616b.poster.avif?t=1716191857\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367590/extras/2005a14f1548b52dbb9e9d0ff073616b.webm?t=1716191857\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367590/extras/2005a14f1548b52dbb9e9d0ff073616b.mp4?t=1716191857\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Dive into an epic journey with MatchVentures, a game that blends the thrill of match-3 gameplay with the intrigue of a mystery narrative. Set beneath a grand castle, this adventure will take you through haunted caves and secret pathways, with a constant threat of lurking hostiles in the dungeons.<br><br>The game offers an array of puzzles and quests designed to challenge your strategic thinking and problem-solving skills. From simple match-3 games to complex puzzles, MatchVentures will keep you engaged for hours on end with its unique blend of fun and difficulty.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367590/extras/37400cefa33a65d09e3547b99fbd259c.poster.avif?t=1716191857\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367590/extras/37400cefa33a65d09e3547b99fbd259c.webm?t=1716191857\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367590/extras/37400cefa33a65d09e3547b99fbd259c.mp4?t=1716191857\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>But the adventure doesn't stop there. The game also introduces an intriguing mechanic that allows you to use your collected resources for castle restorations.  This additional layer of strategy ensures that the gameplay remains fresh and exciting as you progress.<br><br>With a blend of puzzle-solving, castle building, and a compelling narrative, MatchVentures offers a unique gaming experience that's as challenging as it is entertaining. Whether you're a fan of match-3 games, love puzzle-solving, or simply enjoy a good mystery, MatchVentures promises to deliver an unforgettable journey.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367590/extras/dfe565070172a5ac6d07f4054c0942a8.poster.avif?t=1716191857\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367590/extras/dfe565070172a5ac6d07f4054c0942a8.webm?t=1716191857\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367590/extras/dfe565070172a5ac6d07f4054c0942a8.mp4?t=1716191857\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2367590?t=1716191857","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367590/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1716191857","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367590/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1716191857","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367590/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1716191857","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367590/extras/2005a14f1548b52dbb9e9d0ff073616b.poster.avif?t=1716191857\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.ak